{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Delve into the dungeon</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024960/extras/ingame.png?t=1733202036\" /><br>A deep dungeon awaits your exploration. Extreme landscapes, dangerous creatures, treasures, and death.<br>What you will find in the never-ending abyss?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various items to help your exploration</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024960/extras/items.png?t=1733202036\" /><br>Find new items in the dungeon and equip them on your next journey. Find the best loadout and conquer the dungeon.<br>Any items equipped upon death are lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ever changing Environment</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024960/extras/stages.png?t=1733202036\" /><br>The deeper you dive, the harsher the environment will be. The patterns you learned, the techniques you acquired may not be feasible in the next stages of the abyss.<br>Learn to survive the new environment, or return home before you see your demise? If you take the risk or not is solely up to you.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newbie Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024960/4199b4c4ce9015d6ea9ee6d732554fd4ebb3b606.jpg"},{"name":"Touch Dirt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024960/9830ee5b8071aaa04350591588494b8a9e0599cc.jpg"},{"name":"Ant-Hater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024960/723641b8f4b65112f93e4b60e6b31ab93ddbe091.jpg"},{"name":"Stoned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024960/76e82ccf29a2ec76728e3bf50cded2c4a66a0348.jpg"},{"name":"Caveman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024960/8ca7d3435cf90b20b13b8902ce28e03c9787e86